WEBVTT

00:51.340 --> 00:51.380
Tsuya Motors

01:02.050 --> 01:03.510
Excuse me!

01:04.840 --> 01:06.700
Name's Itou. You called?

01:06.700 --> 01:10.000
Ah, so you're Itou? It's out front.

01:19.730 --> 01:23.720
I've been waiting for you, my little Dio!

01:23.720 --> 01:27.140
Come on. Let's get you home.

01:27.140 --> 01:30.110
Please pay for it before you take it, sir.

01:30.110 --> 01:31.540
Ah, oops.

01:31.540 --> 01:33.560
I forgot all about that. My bad.

01:33.340 --> 01:36.380
Starting  today,  I'll!!

01:34.380 --> 01:36.380
Presented by Saizen-Yabai

01:36.380 --> 01:36.420
Broke

01:38.130 --> 01:38.180
and Underhanded

01:46.860 --> 01:50.050
It's so hot. Do something.

01:50.050 --> 01:52.800
It's because you wear that jacket. You look ridiculous.

01:52.800 --> 01:56.330
Shut up. Bad boys have to wear threads that—

01:56.790 --> 01:58.700
Smell ya later, slowpokes!

01:59.920 --> 02:00.820
Itou?

02:00.820 --> 02:02.760
What's with the moped?

02:02.760 --> 02:04.170
He's finally gone and...

02:04.970 --> 02:05.880
Three!

02:09.750 --> 02:10.850
Ain't it sweet?

02:10.850 --> 02:13.740
Itou, I'm saying this for your own good: Take it back!

02:13.740 --> 02:14.740
Why?

02:14.740 --> 02:15.740
You stole it, didn't you?

02:15.740 --> 02:17.640
I bought it, you dumbass!

02:17.640 --> 02:18.810
No way.

02:19.220 --> 02:23.900
Yeah. My parents were against it. So I saved up, little by little.

02:23.900 --> 02:24.990
Itou...

02:25.780 --> 02:28.530
You look stupid on it. Give me the keys.

02:28.530 --> 02:29.240
Not a chance.

02:29.240 --> 02:32.550
Don't be like that. We're friends, aren't we?

02:32.550 --> 02:35.100
The answer is no. I ain't letting anybody touch him.

02:35.100 --> 02:36.710
Right, Dio?

02:37.220 --> 02:40.710
If you want one so bad, get a job.

02:41.670 --> 02:43.340
See ya!

02:46.200 --> 02:47.600
Sweet ride!

02:47.600 --> 02:49.580
Itou looked pretty happy.

02:50.150 --> 02:52.500
He wore a goofy expression the whole time.

02:52.500 --> 02:54.950
Riko, buy me one of those.

02:54.950 --> 02:56.590
Don't be stupid.

02:56.590 --> 02:57.770
Figured as much.

02:57.540 --> 03:00.050
Niko 39

03:00.840 --> 03:02.480
Back in a few.

03:10.720 --> 03:12.700
Well, well, if it isn't Itou.

03:12.700 --> 03:15.230
What's with that dopey grin?

03:15.230 --> 03:17.160
Why don't I show you?

03:17.160 --> 03:20.120
What? Was Mitsuhashi
beaten to a bloody pulp?

03:21.000 --> 03:23.080
Nope, even better.

03:23.080 --> 03:25.040
What? Don't leave us hanging!

03:26.150 --> 03:28.080
I busted my ass getting it...

03:29.390 --> 03:31.660
Hey, man, hurry up!

03:31.660 --> 03:32.510
Almost there.

03:32.510 --> 03:33.890
Hey, you two!

03:34.210 --> 03:34.860
Shit!

03:35.860 --> 03:37.550
My Dio!

03:44.220 --> 03:45.470
Now that's just cruel.

03:47.820 --> 03:52.200
Fuck you and your Dio! It's just a
lame-ass little motor scooter anyway!

03:52.200 --> 03:52.820
Loser!

03:52.820 --> 03:55.220
You little punks! Get back here!

03:55.220 --> 03:56.780
Don't lose your head.

03:57.250 --> 04:00.150
They're just a couple of middle school dickheads who hang around here.

04:00.150 --> 04:02.330
They won't even have pocket change if you catch them.

04:02.330 --> 04:04.720
I can't let this slide!

04:04.720 --> 04:05.540
Relax!

04:05.540 --> 04:07.300
Let me handle this.

04:07.300 --> 04:10.630
They won't pull another stunt like this once I'm through with them.

04:10.630 --> 04:11.660
Okay?

04:12.650 --> 04:13.890
Fine.

04:18.700 --> 04:21.720
Wow, that must've sucked hard.

04:21.720 --> 04:25.650
If it weren't for Imai, I'd have beaten the living crap outta them.

04:28.520 --> 04:30.910
So are you sure your bike's safe?

04:30.910 --> 04:33.990
Hell yeah! It's locked up tighter than a bank vault!

04:33.990 --> 04:37.950
You're slipping, Itou. Locking it up won't work.

04:38.580 --> 04:43.210
Now that you've got Imai involved, won't things get even messier?

04:46.300 --> 04:47.880
Th-The mirrors!

04:48.310 --> 04:49.850
They're gone!

04:49.850 --> 04:52.600
Told you so. I knew this would happen.

04:53.450 --> 04:54.370
Challenge

04:54.370 --> 04:54.460
Challenge

04:54.460 --> 04:54.540
Challenge

04:54.540 --> 04:54.620
Challenge

04:55.040 --> 04:55.160
Challenge

04:56.670 --> 04:59.950
"We got knocked around 'cause you snitched."

04:59.950 --> 05:04.600
"If you want your mirrors back, get your ass to Apartment Park."

05:06.020 --> 05:07.780
Those little pukes!

05:07.780 --> 05:10.650
That's it. I'm gonna whale on their skinny little asses!

05:10.650 --> 05:13.820
Give it up, dude. It's just a mirror.

05:13.820 --> 05:15.920
No, it was <i>two mirrors!</i>

05:15.920 --> 05:20.370
Your rep will suffer if you get all heated over this crap.

05:20.370 --> 05:22.250
What the hell are you saying, Mitsuhashi?!

05:22.250 --> 05:24.200
This isn't even about rep anymore!

05:24.200 --> 05:28.250
You're nuts if you think I'd let someone take something precious to me!

05:29.170 --> 05:31.210
"Precious," huh?

05:31.210 --> 05:34.170
Those guys are gonna pay! Let's go, Mitsuhashi!

05:37.260 --> 05:38.680
Why do <i>I have to come too?</i>

05:38.680 --> 05:39.360
Huh?

05:40.280 --> 05:42.380
I... I see.

05:42.380 --> 05:43.050
Bye.

05:43.050 --> 05:44.140
Hold on!

05:44.140 --> 05:45.310
Mitsuhashi!

05:46.760 --> 05:47.600
The key.

05:49.020 --> 05:52.360
I'll look after your "precious" Dio for you.

05:52.360 --> 05:52.960
But...

05:52.960 --> 05:55.220
What if they take your engine this time?

05:55.220 --> 05:58.130
The mirrors'll be the least of your problems, am I right?

05:58.130 --> 05:59.450
Come on.

06:03.410 --> 06:06.750
Great! Now your Dio's is safer than safe!

06:08.360 --> 06:09.970
I'll take good care of it!

06:10.780 --> 06:12.340
Okay... Bye, then.

06:12.340 --> 06:13.000
Bye!

06:14.250 --> 06:15.040
Mitsuhashi.

06:15.040 --> 06:16.450
C'mon, get going!

06:16.450 --> 06:22.880
Long live Itou Shinji: The epitome of manliness who fights for his "precious" Dio!

06:34.090 --> 06:35.320
He's finally shown up.

06:42.610 --> 06:45.840
You actually came here by
yourself? What a dumbass!

06:45.840 --> 06:50.260
Just because you're a bit older than us doesn't make you hot shit!

06:51.590 --> 06:54.580
You'd best give me back my mirrors, <i>boys.</i>

06:54.580 --> 06:57.490
Or else I won't be able to restrain myself!

06:57.490 --> 06:59.230
Ha, listen to this guy!

06:59.230 --> 07:03.680
You snitched like a bitch, and then these two got beaten up by Beni's boss.

07:03.680 --> 07:05.580
We're hella pissed, yo!

07:05.580 --> 07:07.060
So fuck these mirrors!

07:08.640 --> 07:10.100
You blockhead! Stop that!

07:11.710 --> 07:14.440
Get off of me, you runts! Move it or lose it!

07:15.190 --> 07:17.330
Outta my way! Fucking middle schoolers!

07:17.330 --> 07:18.900
Give me back my mirrors!

07:19.970 --> 07:21.470
That was a low blow, kid!

07:21.470 --> 07:23.550
Yeah, take him out!

07:23.550 --> 07:25.700
Stupid fuck. Bugging out over a dumb mirror—

07:32.230 --> 07:35.920
Hey, kid! I won't go easy on you like Itou did.

07:35.920 --> 07:38.880
Th-That blond hair... Are you...

07:40.090 --> 07:45.220
I really fucking hate it when people recognize Imai but still don't know who we are!

07:45.220 --> 07:46.880
Oh, Mitsuhashi!

07:46.880 --> 07:47.720
Mitsuhashi?!

07:48.170 --> 07:51.520
Hey, young'uns. If you don't behave yourselves...

07:54.400 --> 07:55.860
I'll fucking eat you!

07:59.430 --> 08:00.690
Punk kids.

08:01.390 --> 08:04.170
Mitsuhashi, you came after all!

08:04.170 --> 08:07.190
'Course I did. I couldn't leave my best bro to fight alone.

08:07.190 --> 08:09.580
Aw shoot, they got dust all over you.

08:11.750 --> 08:13.620
A-Are you hurt anywhere, Itou?

08:13.620 --> 08:16.380
I-Is there something I should know, Mitsuhashi?

08:23.420 --> 08:25.670
Is... Is... Is...

08:25.670 --> 08:27.110
Is this... my...

08:27.110 --> 08:30.470
I-Itou, calm down. Calm down and listen to me.

08:40.820 --> 08:43.470
Mitsuhashi, you're revving it up too much!

08:43.470 --> 08:46.400
Itou practically babies that thing!

08:46.400 --> 08:49.520
You ditz! It's all about redlining it.

08:49.520 --> 08:53.370
I need to push this Dio to the limit to show it what real riders are like!

08:57.330 --> 08:58.260
What the...

09:05.180 --> 09:07.050
Dang...

09:22.620 --> 09:23.990
I-I didn't mean it!

09:24.440 --> 09:26.700
You feel me, don't you, Itou?

09:26.700 --> 09:28.680
Right? Right? Come on...

09:29.640 --> 09:30.450
Itou!

09:30.820 --> 09:34.430
Itou?! Little Itou! Itou the Great!

09:38.420 --> 09:40.210
Poor bastard.

09:40.210 --> 09:43.750
That was cruel, even for Mitsuhashi. He'd only just bought it!

09:43.750 --> 09:46.200
Really? I don't believe that guy.

09:46.200 --> 09:47.680
I really feel for Itou.

10:02.430 --> 10:04.190
We just heard.

10:04.190 --> 10:08.280
I knew you were evil and all, but not Satan himself!

10:08.280 --> 10:08.990
You monster.

10:10.820 --> 10:14.540
You knew how much Itou loved that thing.

10:14.540 --> 10:16.760
You shouldn't treat motorbikes like mere machines!

10:16.760 --> 10:19.580
A bike's more than just a friendly companion to a young man!

10:19.580 --> 10:20.730
Straight up!

10:20.730 --> 10:26.340
It's a comrade that feels the same breeze as you and goes on the same trips! Yet, you...

10:26.340 --> 10:28.350
He'd only just bought the goddamn thing!

10:28.350 --> 10:29.910
Don't be stupid!

10:29.910 --> 10:32.300
He already started making memories with that motorbike the moment he bought it!

10:32.300 --> 10:33.820
You gotta feel for the guy.

10:33.820 --> 10:37.520
He was so happy that he slept next to it the night he bought it.

10:37.520 --> 10:38.940
Which makes you a...

10:38.940 --> 10:39.770
...monster!

10:39.770 --> 10:40.770
The Devil!

10:40.770 --> 10:41.500
The Grim Reaper!

10:41.500 --> 10:43.020
Dumbass!

10:49.140 --> 10:50.400
Mitsuhashi residen—

10:50.400 --> 10:53.330
Three, did you come up with anything?

10:53.330 --> 10:56.410
Shut up! I don't need your damn help!

10:56.960 --> 10:59.620
Good, I wasn't going to offer you any!

10:59.620 --> 11:03.380
However, I was looking through this magazine and found something that'd be perfect.

11:03.690 --> 11:04.590
What's that?

11:04.590 --> 11:06.690
Work! A part-time job!

11:06.690 --> 11:09.420
Gimme a break! Why do I hafta work?!

11:09.420 --> 11:12.340
How else are you going to get the money?

11:12.120 --> 11:12.170
1000 yen per hour

11:12.120 --> 11:12.170
Café Terrasse

11:12.120 --> 11:12.170
Pierrot

11:12.770 --> 11:15.310
You know, I even found one that's offering 1,000 yen an hour.

11:15.310 --> 11:16.870
A thousand?

11:16.870 --> 11:19.600
So after ten hours, you'll have 10,000,

11:19.600 --> 11:21.140
100,000 after a hundred hours,

11:21.140 --> 11:23.280
and you'll be a millionaire after a thousand hours?!

11:24.720 --> 11:28.660
Who needs a Dio? I'd be able to buy a Ferrari or a Benz with money to spare!

11:28.660 --> 11:29.170
You'll do it?

11:29.170 --> 11:30.370
Damn right I will!

11:30.370 --> 11:33.740
I'll go down there first thing tomorrow, and you've got to come along too, okay?!

11:36.200 --> 11:39.200
Jeez, he could've at least thanked me!

11:38.980 --> 11:41.940
Shaved Ice

11:41.950 --> 11:41.990
Looking For

11:41.950 --> 11:41.990
Part Time

11:41.950 --> 11:41.990
Worker

11:41.950 --> 11:41.990
Starting at
1,000 yen/hour

11:41.950 --> 11:43.450
High School Students
University Students
Vocational School
Students

11:42.630 --> 11:47.120
What the hell?! There are a whole heap of blonds in <i>other countries!</i>

11:47.720 --> 11:49.610
We've already filled the position.

11:49.610 --> 11:51.510
Then, why is your sign still up?!

11:51.840 --> 11:56.510
Bastard! I'll remember this place! I'm never coming to this shop again, goddammit!

11:57.220 --> 11:59.760
What the hell is your problem?!

11:59.760 --> 12:02.560
I wouldn't work for you for a mere 1,000 yen anyway!

12:02.340 --> 12:08.600
Original Blend ¥180

12:02.340 --> 12:08.600
Recruiting Staff

12:02.340 --> 12:08.600
900 yen

12:02.340 --> 12:08.600
per hour

12:02.340 --> 12:08.600
Waiters

12:02.340 --> 12:08.600
Kitchen

12:02.340 --> 12:08.600
Staff

12:02.340 --> 12:08.600
More Details Inside

12:02.560 --> 12:07.170
Don't judge a book by its cover! How would <i>you know if I've got a short fuse or not?!</i>

12:07.170 --> 12:08.840
Huh? I just proved it?

12:09.310 --> 12:12.310
Able to Work
3+ Days a Week

12:09.310 --> 12:12.310
High School Age or Older

12:09.310 --> 12:12.310
Beginners Welcome

12:09.530 --> 12:12.530
Numbnuts! Nobody turns down Mitsuhashi!

12:13.240 --> 12:17.310
Pretty please with a cherry on top? Help a brother out!

12:18.570 --> 12:19.840
That's how you're gonna be?

12:19.840 --> 12:22.250
I'm talking to you! Hey!

12:25.610 --> 12:27.380
What a bunch of shitheads.

12:27.880 --> 12:31.380
They've got me to thank for this shopping district being safe!

12:31.380 --> 12:34.600
Well, that's what you get for fighting all the time.

12:34.600 --> 12:35.340
Buzz off.

12:35.340 --> 12:40.230
You need to take things seriously from now on. I'll be here to support—

12:40.780 --> 12:44.350
I'm only asking for a little! Go on, lend me some money!

12:45.230 --> 12:48.120
That's not a part-time job!

12:48.120 --> 12:49.190
Right you are.

13:00.100 --> 13:01.580
Lessee here...

13:01.890 --> 13:04.450
My hair should be fine now.

13:11.380 --> 13:14.960
Then, he climbed the tree at the end.

13:14.960 --> 13:16.030
What?

13:19.140 --> 13:21.140
You're in high school, right?

13:20.920 --> 13:22.880
July 10, 1995
Mitsuhashi Takashi
12-31-1977
Chiba
Chiba Prefecture
Tsuya City
Tsuya-Cho 1-2-3
Same as above
Transfered
to Chiba
Prefectural
Nanyou High School
No Awards or Censures

13:21.680 --> 13:25.120
Yes. I'm a straight-laced high school student who's never been in a fight.

13:25.120 --> 13:28.100
And I don't have blond or spiky hair.

13:28.100 --> 13:30.220
Yes, I can see that.

13:30.220 --> 13:32.190
Okay, you're hired.

13:32.800 --> 13:36.180
We're an upmarket establishment, so be sure to conduct yourself accordingly.

13:36.940 --> 13:39.040
Then, I'll fit in perfectly.

13:46.950 --> 13:48.630
Let me introduce your new coworker.

13:48.980 --> 13:52.230
This is our new employee, Mitsuhashi.

13:52.230 --> 13:53.180
Nice to meet you.

13:53.180 --> 13:53.840
Same here.

13:53.840 --> 13:56.380
If you have any questions, feel free to ask him.

13:56.380 --> 13:57.570
I'll leave you to it.

13:58.100 --> 14:01.010
You'll catch on quick. The job's not that difficult.

14:01.010 --> 14:02.600
Good.

14:08.080 --> 14:09.110
Mitsuhashi?

14:09.110 --> 14:10.940
Y-Yes, what is it?

14:11.290 --> 14:15.850
Whenever a customer walks in, say, "Welcome!" loudly, okay?

14:15.850 --> 14:16.560
Sure.

14:16.560 --> 14:19.750
But don't shout too loudly. We're not running a tavern here.

14:20.700 --> 14:21.820
What else...

14:21.820 --> 14:23.210
Can I ask you something?

14:23.210 --> 14:24.000
What is it?

14:24.000 --> 14:25.790
Who's the goliath?

14:25.790 --> 14:27.330
Oh, you mean Isada?

14:27.330 --> 14:28.290
Yeah.

14:28.290 --> 14:30.190
You shouldn't mess with him.

14:30.190 --> 14:32.580
I hear he runs the Asagiri High crew.

14:32.580 --> 14:34.450
He's a little scary, so you'd better watch your step.

14:34.450 --> 14:35.550
Hey!

14:36.000 --> 14:37.470
Come with me!

14:37.470 --> 14:38.890
Huh? Me?

14:38.890 --> 14:40.990
Isada, he's only just started.

14:40.990 --> 14:43.650
I ain't talking to you!

14:43.650 --> 14:45.930
I'm gonna "train" this one personally.

14:46.400 --> 14:47.660
Isada...

14:47.660 --> 14:49.310
Thanks. I'll enjoy learning from you.

14:49.310 --> 14:50.400
M-Mitsuhashi!

14:51.510 --> 14:52.690
No need to worry—

14:52.690 --> 14:53.730
Move your ass!

14:54.730 --> 14:55.830
H-Hey, wait!

14:55.830 --> 14:56.690
Shut your piehole!

15:12.660 --> 15:15.590
So... what do you want me to do?

15:16.720 --> 15:19.040
I guess I'll get you to do the dishes.

15:28.310 --> 15:31.960
Man, these part-time jobs are a cinch!

15:31.960 --> 15:32.890
Uh...

15:32.890 --> 15:34.840
What? You got a fucking problem?

15:34.840 --> 15:35.860
No, no problems over here.

15:36.370 --> 15:42.820
You're a tough nut, so I just figured you must be pretty notorious around these parts.

15:43.700 --> 15:44.780
You can tell?

15:44.780 --> 15:46.320
Of course!

15:46.320 --> 15:49.610
I assume you're working here incognito, right?

15:49.610 --> 15:52.380
Aw shucks, looks like you caught me.

15:52.380 --> 15:53.390
You are?

15:53.390 --> 15:55.240
Let me guess who you are!

15:55.240 --> 15:57.020
Sure, go right ahead!

15:57.020 --> 16:01.310
That strength, those hidden talents, those manly features...

16:01.310 --> 16:02.140
You must be...

16:02.140 --> 16:02.790
I must be...

16:02.790 --> 16:04.650
...Satoshi from Akehisa!

16:05.540 --> 16:05.790
Kara Ore

16:05.540 --> 16:05.790
Kyou

16:05.540 --> 16:05.790
Wa

16:05.540 --> 16:05.790
Watch
Volumes
2 & 3!

16:05.750 --> 16:05.790
Satoshi

16:05.850 --> 16:11.430
Dumbass! He looks like he's fucking constipated! Don't compare me to him!

16:11.430 --> 16:12.830
S-Sorry!

16:12.830 --> 16:15.100
There are stronger guys than him!

16:15.100 --> 16:16.900
Oh, now I get it!

16:16.900 --> 16:19.500
This time I've got it, no mistake!

16:19.500 --> 16:22.580
That's the way! Lay it on me!

16:22.580 --> 16:23.990
Beni High's Imai!

16:24.860 --> 16:25.950
Huh, was I wrong?

16:26.700 --> 16:30.650
For Chrissake! Don't you <i>ever lump me with the likes of that loser, fuckwit!</i>

16:30.650 --> 16:31.990
Sorry!

16:31.990 --> 16:34.210
So... if it's not him...

16:34.210 --> 16:38.080
Your empty head is forgetting someone with way more rep!

16:38.080 --> 16:39.630
More rep?

16:40.620 --> 16:41.670
Ah!

16:41.670 --> 16:45.820
Forgive me. I completely forgot about that guy in a league of his own.

16:45.820 --> 16:47.490
Yes, that's about right!

16:47.490 --> 16:48.340
Nanyou High's...

16:48.340 --> 16:49.760
Bingo! Nanyou High's...

16:49.760 --> 16:50.390
...Itou.

16:52.210 --> 16:55.170
Shit-for-brains! Can't you fucking tell by the 'do?!

16:55.660 --> 16:56.900
Th-Those blond locks!

17:00.160 --> 17:01.570
What's up with you?

17:01.570 --> 17:03.730
I-I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

17:03.730 --> 17:06.200
Please spare me! I don't have any money on me!

17:06.600 --> 17:09.330
Please spare my life!

17:09.330 --> 17:10.660
Oh boy...

17:11.650 --> 17:15.120
How does everyone else see me?

17:18.540 --> 17:21.500
Mitsuhashi really got a job?

17:21.500 --> 17:24.840
Yeah, though I doubt he'll last very long.

17:24.840 --> 17:26.280
You're mean, Itou.

17:26.280 --> 17:28.220
This is Mitsuhashi we're talking about.

17:28.220 --> 17:32.350
Say what you will, he does feel responsible for what happened.

17:32.770 --> 17:36.340
Yeah, though I'm not all that worked up about it now.

17:36.340 --> 17:38.540
But it might just be the medicine he needs.

17:38.540 --> 17:39.490
I agree.

17:39.490 --> 17:40.820
Oh yeah!

17:41.290 --> 17:43.240
Speaking of medicine...

17:44.040 --> 17:46.780
I have a friend who works in a drugstore.

17:46.780 --> 17:49.210
Her name's Misako.

17:49.210 --> 17:56.500
Misako's going to meet up with a pen pal who just happens to be Imai of Beni High.

17:56.500 --> 17:57.360
Huh?

17:57.360 --> 17:58.290
<i>The Imai?</i>

17:58.290 --> 18:02.670
Imai says he's captain of the basketball team.

18:02.670 --> 18:04.260
So what do you think?

18:05.440 --> 18:09.180
This is the first I've heard of him being captain of a basketball team.

18:09.180 --> 18:11.970
I get it! He's trying to score chicks!

18:18.470 --> 18:19.560
Nailed it!

18:19.560 --> 18:23.400
Imai, are you really going in that getup?

18:24.260 --> 18:27.610
I <i>did tell her I was captain of the basketball team.</i>

18:29.380 --> 18:33.260
I think it'd be better if you just wore normal clothes.

18:33.260 --> 18:34.530
You think so?

18:45.630 --> 18:49.780
This is my first time meeting up with a girl.

18:49.780 --> 18:52.490
Will it turn out okay? Will she really show up?

18:52.490 --> 18:53.700
Excuse me...

19:00.060 --> 19:02.060
Are you Imai from Beni High?

19:02.720 --> 19:05.150
Score! Lord have mercy!

19:05.560 --> 19:07.890
Indeed! I am Beni High's Imai.

19:07.890 --> 19:10.360
Nice to meet you. I'm Takenaka Misako.

19:10.880 --> 19:14.480
I'm good! I'm Imai Katsutoshi! I-It's a pleasure to meet you!

19:16.080 --> 19:18.960
You did it! Good for you, Imai!

19:18.960 --> 19:22.270
Enjoy the springtime of your life!

19:36.490 --> 19:39.950
W-Would you like to go to a café around here, Misako?

19:39.950 --> 19:40.780
Sure.

19:43.770 --> 19:45.100
So, um...

19:46.690 --> 19:48.640
It sure is hot today.

19:48.640 --> 19:51.250
Oh, would you like to order anything?

19:51.250 --> 19:52.700
Yeah, sure.

19:54.290 --> 19:56.560
I-I'm sorry.

19:59.390 --> 20:01.390
I touched her hand!

20:01.390 --> 20:03.460
Her soft, white hand!

20:04.370 --> 20:06.680
I could explode with happiness!

20:06.680 --> 20:10.160
I'd love to show that idiot Mitsuhashi a picture of us together!

20:10.160 --> 20:12.050
Go to hell, douchebag!

20:16.100 --> 20:17.930
Welcome, folks.

20:20.020 --> 20:21.890
Mitsuhashi!

20:22.470 --> 20:24.270
What's wrong, Imai?

20:24.270 --> 20:25.490
Imai?

20:26.190 --> 20:27.980
I-It's all over!

20:33.320 --> 20:37.280
L-Luck's never on his side when he needs it.

20:38.080 --> 20:39.740
Hey, Isada!

20:40.160 --> 20:41.450
Yes, what is it?

20:41.970 --> 20:44.940
I'll take care of the kitchen, you take the floor.

20:44.940 --> 20:46.130
What?

20:46.130 --> 20:48.490
G-Give me a break!

20:48.490 --> 20:51.970
Why do I have to deal with Beni High's gang leader?

20:51.970 --> 20:53.310
Just do it!

20:53.310 --> 20:56.830
You'll be fine. I'm always back here if things get hairy, okay?

20:56.830 --> 20:58.250
B-But...

20:58.250 --> 21:00.260
Come on, don't ya see them over there?

21:00.260 --> 21:02.980
Don't those two by the window make the <i>perfect couple?</i>

21:02.980 --> 21:03.730
Huh?

21:04.680 --> 21:06.730
Imai? Imai?

21:07.060 --> 21:07.690
Yes?

21:08.110 --> 21:11.240
Are you okay? You look pale.

21:11.240 --> 21:15.450
If you're not feeling well, we can do this another time.

21:17.140 --> 21:19.090
She's such a thoughtful girl.

21:19.090 --> 21:21.690
No! Get a grip, Imai Katsutoshi!

21:21.690 --> 21:27.070
I'm not gonna let this chance of a lifetime pass me by because Mitsuhashi's harassing me!

21:29.210 --> 21:30.880
No, I'm fine!

21:31.230 --> 21:34.130
I was only thinking about our upcoming game, that's all.

21:34.130 --> 21:38.510
Wow! You basketball captains have a lot on your plate!

21:38.510 --> 21:40.040
Guess we do...

21:46.760 --> 21:47.810
Can I help you?

21:48.440 --> 21:51.530
You're Imai, Beni High's gang leader, aren't you?

21:55.090 --> 21:56.240
Oh, gosh.

21:56.240 --> 21:59.310
I may go to Beni, but I'm on the basketball team...

21:59.310 --> 22:03.330
I'm the gang leader of Asagiri High, Isada.

22:03.800 --> 22:07.150
Oh, is that right? Well, good for you.

22:07.150 --> 22:10.170
Gosh, people always mistake me for someone else.

22:11.090 --> 22:14.090
I'd love to take you on at least once.

22:14.090 --> 22:14.940
Basta—

22:18.930 --> 22:20.340
You've made a mistake...

22:20.340 --> 22:21.550
Don't play dumb!

22:21.550 --> 22:22.680
Order up!

22:22.680 --> 22:23.640
Gotcha!

22:26.140 --> 22:30.160
Honestly, I have no idea how to handle these lunatics sometimes.

22:30.160 --> 22:31.520
I wouldn't have a clue either.

22:31.870 --> 22:34.840
Tell me about it. They're irritating, aren't they?

22:35.640 --> 22:36.280
Huh?

22:39.890 --> 22:42.280
Hey, I didn't order this.

22:42.280 --> 22:44.830
This is our apology for my earlier conduct.

22:44.830 --> 22:48.210
I had no idea you knew Mitsuhashi.

22:48.210 --> 22:51.520
Mitsuhashi told me to serve these to you two.

22:51.520 --> 22:52.670
Good luck!

22:53.750 --> 22:57.270
Mitsuhashi, you're such a nice person!

22:58.660 --> 23:00.630
I'm so ashamed of myself!

23:00.630 --> 23:03.350
Um, is it okay for me to have some too?

23:03.350 --> 23:05.930
Yes, go ahead. By all means!

23:05.930 --> 23:07.700
He's a good friend of mine, after all.

23:07.700 --> 23:09.810
Really? That's great!

23:09.810 --> 23:11.540
Thanks for the food.

23:12.810 --> 23:14.210
This <i>does look good.</i>

23:18.390 --> 23:20.040
Delicious!

23:20.040 --> 23:21.740
What's wrong, Imai?

23:22.190 --> 23:24.740
Yes, it really is scrummy.

23:27.770 --> 23:29.460
Cooking sauce!

23:32.800 --> 23:34.530
What a clown.

23:34.530 --> 23:37.330
Mitsuhashi, what did you put in there?

23:37.330 --> 23:37.920
Hm?

23:41.880 --> 23:44.250
and added my unique blend of secret spices!

23:44.170 --> 23:44.210
Tomato
Ketchup

23:44.250 --> 23:46.210
I call it "The Mitsuhashi Special"!

23:46.210 --> 23:48.890
What do you think? Sounds delish, don't it?

23:46.340 --> 23:46.380
Tomato
Ketchup

23:48.630 --> 23:48.670
Rice Vinegar

23:48.630 --> 23:48.670
Motonari

23:48.630 --> 23:48.670
Wasabi

23:48.630 --> 23:48.670
Seaweed

23:48.630 --> 23:48.670
Marudaizu

23:48.630 --> 23:48.670
Soy Sauce

23:48.630 --> 23:48.670
Pork

23:48.630 --> 23:48.670
Sauce

23:49.680 --> 23:51.850
<i>Nobody could eat that concoction!</i>

23:54.640 --> 23:59.280
Sh-Should we leave now, Misako?

24:00.540 --> 24:01.740
Yeah, okay.

24:03.910 --> 24:04.700
I'm dying!

24:07.720 --> 24:08.910
Imai!

24:21.190 --> 24:23.160
Are you still feeling sick?

24:23.160 --> 24:26.430
N-No, I'm fine. I just got a little nervous.

24:26.430 --> 24:30.570
Thank goodness. The way you fell over worried me.

24:30.570 --> 24:31.810
Misako.

24:32.470 --> 24:33.950
I'm fit as a fiddle. See?

24:33.950 --> 24:37.020
Just to let you know, there's no one who can beat me in brute strength.

24:37.840 --> 24:40.510
So you're good at arm wrestling?

24:41.240 --> 24:43.320
Would you care to challenge me?

24:43.320 --> 24:44.390
Gladly.

24:44.390 --> 24:47.200
But just to warn you, I'm pretty strong myself.

24:47.200 --> 24:48.190
Here.

24:54.740 --> 24:56.800
I'm holding her hand!

24:56.800 --> 24:59.300
Now I have no choice but to marry her.

25:00.420 --> 25:03.050
How naughty...

25:05.040 --> 25:07.140
No!

25:08.590 --> 25:10.340
Who were those people?

25:10.340 --> 25:14.010
Uh, I'm sure they were just passing by.

25:17.030 --> 25:18.170
Oh, it's chilly!

25:18.170 --> 25:20.440
Imai, come join me!

25:20.440 --> 25:23.070
Okay! I'm coming!

25:24.160 --> 25:25.770
Over here!

25:25.770 --> 25:27.420
O-Oh you!

25:28.640 --> 25:30.500
Try and catch me!

25:30.500 --> 25:32.220
Hey, wait!

25:36.340 --> 25:38.130
I'm the luckiest man alive!

25:38.130 --> 25:39.390
What's this?

25:41.090 --> 25:43.460
Look, a crab.

25:43.460 --> 25:45.820
Yeah, it really is a crab.

25:54.850 --> 25:56.140
She smells nice.

25:57.500 --> 26:00.060
All this happiness is filling my lungs!

26:09.400 --> 26:09.440
Argh

26:14.020 --> 26:16.310
Misako!

26:19.210 --> 26:22.530
I really pity you, Imai!

26:24.860 --> 26:27.130
He's so fucking predictable!

26:32.320 --> 26:33.480
Is that what happened?

26:34.100 --> 26:36.600
You gotta feel for that guy.

26:37.440 --> 26:42.560
I still can't believe he walked into
Mitsuhashi's café of all places.

26:42.560 --> 26:44.730
How unlucky can you get?

26:44.730 --> 26:47.880
So Mitsuhashi's actually working, huh?

26:47.880 --> 26:49.840
What? You didn't believe he was?

26:50.500 --> 26:51.630
Not really.

27:04.730 --> 27:06.590
What? You don't have those?

27:06.590 --> 27:08.050
We don't, I'm afraid.

27:09.690 --> 27:11.010
Mitsuhashi...

27:12.180 --> 27:13.720
Man, I'm bushed.

27:16.520 --> 27:19.620
Isada, go clean the toilets or something.

27:19.620 --> 27:21.910
But I'm not done washing the dishes!

27:21.910 --> 27:23.290
Is that backtalk I'm hearing?

27:24.010 --> 27:25.420
Okay, fine!

27:25.420 --> 27:28.690
Goddammit, how did I get stuck doing everything?

27:28.690 --> 27:30.650
Huh? You got something to say?

27:30.650 --> 27:32.320
N-No, nothing at all.

27:39.060 --> 27:42.370
Isada's started taking his work
seriously since you came along.

27:42.370 --> 27:46.060
Guys like him just need a little <i>discipline, that's all.</i>

27:46.060 --> 27:47.500
You're a real lifesaver.

27:48.060 --> 27:51.840
By the way, why did you take this job?

27:53.400 --> 27:55.300
Uh, well...

28:04.330 --> 28:06.690
I've got my reasons.

28:07.190 --> 28:08.460
What is it?

28:08.460 --> 28:09.900
Th-This is bad!

28:10.270 --> 28:12.780
Some real lowlifes just entered our restaurant!

28:12.780 --> 28:14.740
Real lowlifes?

28:22.030 --> 28:23.720
Kokoro!

28:31.140 --> 28:33.840
The guy at the end... His name's Igarashi.

28:34.180 --> 28:36.880
He's one frightening motherfucker!

28:36.880 --> 28:39.050
Even <i>I'm scared of him!</i>

28:39.050 --> 28:41.630
Who cares who they are? Go take their order!

28:41.630 --> 28:45.850
Y-Yeah right! Do you have any idea the things they did to me?

28:45.850 --> 28:49.080
God, you're pathetic.
Are you really a gang leader?

28:49.080 --> 28:50.870
What the fuck you waiting for?

28:50.870 --> 28:52.820
Yes, coming!

28:52.820 --> 28:55.510
Then, get your asses in gear!

28:55.510 --> 28:57.240
Thanks for waiting!

28:58.210 --> 29:01.580
How do you do? May I take your orders?

29:09.360 --> 29:11.880
What's with that hairdo? You new here?

29:12.240 --> 29:15.800
I am. I believe that people remember me better like this.

29:16.870 --> 29:18.950
This jerk's a pretty boy.

29:18.950 --> 29:20.290
I'm sorry to say I am.

29:20.290 --> 29:22.010
Quit your clowning!

29:22.010 --> 29:23.310
Yes, sorry!

29:25.770 --> 29:28.580
Whoops! That was clumsy of you.

29:28.580 --> 29:30.810
You got beef with us?!

29:30.810 --> 29:32.630
No! Of course not!

29:32.630 --> 29:33.090
Hey!

29:33.090 --> 29:33.740
Yes?

29:34.110 --> 29:36.200
You just gonna stand there or what?

29:36.200 --> 29:37.820
Whatever do you mean?

29:37.820 --> 29:39.910
My shoes are all wet!

29:47.260 --> 29:48.960
I-I'm very sorry that happened.

29:48.960 --> 29:50.170
Can't hear you.

29:52.130 --> 29:53.880
He says he can't fucking hear you!

29:54.530 --> 29:55.840
I...

29:55.840 --> 29:59.050
I'm very sorry that happened!

29:59.820 --> 30:00.960
Mitsuhashi...

30:05.650 --> 30:06.640
Mitsuhashi!

30:07.190 --> 30:07.980
How...

30:08.900 --> 30:09.920
How'd it go?

30:09.920 --> 30:12.110
D-Did they do anything to you?

30:13.640 --> 30:14.570
Mitsuhashi?

30:15.130 --> 30:17.530
Goddammit! Fucking prick! Rat bastard! Shit! Fuck!

30:17.120 --> 30:18.910
Please don't take it out on me!

30:18.910 --> 30:21.700
Fucking do this! And that! And this shit! Fuck you!

30:27.600 --> 30:30.840
Jeez, that blond kid sure didn't know his place.

30:30.840 --> 30:32.620
I was about to punch him a good two or three times.

30:32.620 --> 30:35.080
I wouldn't be satisfied with just punching him.

30:39.980 --> 30:41.510
Who the fuck are you?

30:41.930 --> 30:46.480
Since my partner-in-crime's working right now, I've got too much time on my hands.

30:46.480 --> 30:49.430
What's this? You looking to go a few rounds?

30:49.430 --> 30:52.740
Do you have any idea who you're talking to?!

30:52.740 --> 30:57.780
Yeah, two stupid cocksuckers who cause trouble for working people!

30:58.370 --> 31:01.610
Igarashi, let me take care of this dickwad.

31:01.610 --> 31:02.780
Sure.

31:02.780 --> 31:04.370
I'll teach you a lesson!

31:10.340 --> 31:11.920
Wh-Who <i>is this guy?</i>

31:21.800 --> 31:23.830
Now it's your turn!

31:23.830 --> 31:25.690
What's the matter? Come on!

31:26.660 --> 31:28.640
You little punkass... Go fuck yourself!

31:36.900 --> 31:39.100
Guess we <i>do live in a big city.</i>

31:39.100 --> 31:41.860
Figures there'd be tough guys like you running around.

31:41.860 --> 31:44.160
You can have the next punch.

31:44.160 --> 31:46.370
What's the matter, Spikes? Come on!

31:47.300 --> 31:48.080
Let's do this!

31:48.630 --> 31:49.580
Dipshit!

31:56.850 --> 31:58.420
Fucking asswipe!

31:58.420 --> 32:01.020
What? Is that all you've got?

32:01.020 --> 32:02.630
Not so fast...

32:02.630 --> 32:05.600
Time to make you taste some steel!

32:09.140 --> 32:10.180
Bastard!

32:12.690 --> 32:14.610
Stand still, dammit!

32:19.200 --> 32:19.990
Shit...

32:22.360 --> 32:24.670
That sound was music to my ears.

32:24.670 --> 32:27.450
You sure you didn't break a bone or something?

32:28.510 --> 32:30.750
That'd only put us on an equal footing.

32:31.750 --> 32:36.130
You and your big mouth. I'll make sure to shut it up for good!

32:47.770 --> 32:48.930
You're that...

32:49.640 --> 32:52.890
Yep. The adorable waiter with the shit-eating grin.

32:53.210 --> 32:53.930
Asshole!

32:53.930 --> 32:55.960
Mitsuhashi, get out of here!

32:56.470 --> 32:57.600
Mitsuhashi?

32:57.600 --> 33:00.610
Wait, you're Mitsuhashi from Nanyou?

33:00.610 --> 33:03.490
Oh, you've heard of me? I'm honored.

33:03.490 --> 33:06.140
Good! You'll make a sweet opponent!

33:06.140 --> 33:07.860
Aren't you still on the clock?

33:07.860 --> 33:11.620
Don't worry about it. The café's got plenty of staff to cover for me.

33:11.620 --> 33:15.370
Mitsuhashi, I thought you were taking your job seriously!

33:15.370 --> 33:16.230
Hey!

33:16.230 --> 33:19.090
Mind your own fucking business. This is <i>my fight—</i>

33:19.090 --> 33:20.670
No, it's <i>my fight!</i>

33:21.340 --> 33:25.380
Itou! There are times when even bros need to back off!

33:25.380 --> 33:28.020
Right back at you, Mitsuhashi!

33:28.020 --> 33:29.640
I was the one who called this fight!

33:29.640 --> 33:33.280
Asshat! You don't even have any fucking beef with him, bitch!

33:33.280 --> 33:36.420
Dumbass! I do have fucking beef with him, bitch!

33:36.420 --> 33:40.360
Hey, fuckholes! Quit ignoring me!

33:40.360 --> 33:42.320
Come at <i>me , goddammit!</i>

33:40.360 --> 33:42.740
You're always fucking doing this!

33:42.740 --> 33:43.940
The fuck do I care?

33:43.140 --> 33:43.940
Hey, I'm talking to you!

33:46.110 --> 33:47.280
Shut the fuck up!

33:48.140 --> 33:49.940
Mitsuhashi, get back to work!

33:49.940 --> 33:51.900
I'm tired. I think I'll go home.

33:51.900 --> 33:53.620
You dickless wonder!

33:53.620 --> 33:56.750
Itou, you know how hard it is doing a part-time job?

33:56.750 --> 33:58.950
I knew it'd be hard from the start!

33:58.950 --> 34:03.090
Blondie... Spikes... I'll remember this!

34:14.800 --> 34:20.690
Your locks of hair tickled my nostrils.

34:20.690 --> 34:26.290
And that's where our romance ended.

34:26.290 --> 34:29.130
Ah, there goes my youth...

34:29.130 --> 34:32.190
How long will Mitsuhashi keep his job?

34:32.190 --> 34:35.140
The vengeful Igarashi gang is preparing its counterattack.

34:35.140 --> 34:37.900
And is this how Imai Katsutoshi's romance is going to end?

34:37.900 --> 34:40.500
Is Itou going to get his Dio back?!

34:40.500 --> 34:42.570
Stay tooned for Part Six!

34:42.570 --> 34:45.800
...that's where it ended!

34:45.800 --> 34:50.540
Imai! Let's go home already!

34:52.350 --> 34:54.850
Imai...

35:01.510 --> 35:01.550
Presented by Saizen-Yabai

35:01.510 --> 35:01.550
Starting  today,  I'll!!

35:04.390 --> 35:04.430
Broke

35:06.520 --> 35:06.560
and Underhanded

35:09.560 --> 35:11.760
Karaoke

35:09.560 --> 35:11.670
Let's worry about the future tomorrow.

35:11.670 --> 35:14.490
When tomorrow comes, it'll all work out.

35:17.670 --> 35:19.710
If it doesn't work out, I'll just run away.

35:19.710 --> 35:22.150
If I'm found, I'll make up an excuse.

35:49.660 --> 35:51.630
On stressful days, I'll hit you.

35:51.630 --> 35:54.320
Then, I'll say, "I'm sorry," and you'll forgive me.

35:57.540 --> 35:59.080
That cute girl is mine,

35:59.080 --> 36:02.210
but I belong to no one.

36:05.610 --> 36:07.630
We're all brothers and sisters in this world.

36:09.590 --> 36:11.670
We are all brothers and sisters in this world.

36:11.670 --> 36:13.590
Even the going gets tough, the tough kick and scream.

36:41.640 --> 36:43.630
You and me are friends, partner.

36:43.630 --> 36:45.610
If the going gets tough, the tough say goodbye.

36:57.610 --> 36:59.590
I Help You

36:59.590 --> 37:02.430
I Like You

37:00.530 --> 37:02.430
We're family.

37:06.920 --> 37:08.800
Until next time!
